---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout title="About – Adil Zhantaev" description="About Adil Zhantaev.">
  <h1 class="mb-4 text-3xl font-bold">About me</h1>
  <div class="space-y-4">
    <p>
      I'm a frontend developer with a background in web design and UI/UX. I started my career in
      web design in 2016 and transitioned into frontend development in 2020.
    </p>
    <p>
      I currently work at Urbanlinx Media, contributing to HotNewHipHop, where I help build and
      maintain modern web applications. My work includes developing reusable UI components,
      migrating legacy PHP-based pages to modern frameworks, improving performance and technical
      SEO, and working with technologies such as React, Next.js, Astro, and TypeScript.
    </p>
    <p>
      I'm interested in building better web experiences, exploring modern development workflows,
      and learning how AI tools and agents can improve the way we design, build, and maintain
      software.
    </p>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
